<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 16:45:23 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Hebrewme</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebrewme dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrewme</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb.</para>
  <para style="mt">Hebrews</para>
  <para style="mt">Hebrewme dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Hebrewme laisiu raukegaibe de cilu meliede, laisiukwak aide AD 60 kekamle dau ge raugai auzie. Cidau ting Rome ga ngqwa ga mina de teikeherei eh kenang bamsüt di. Laisiu aide Palestine ga mede Rome ga Jew Khristianme de mine teikeherei kecu ziemne penui kenlumde gidi eh Jewme kenlum ga cailigwang dilai eh mteipwa kebamme dage raukegai ge.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hebrewme laisiu aide Jew Khristianme dage Khristianme kenlum au ma pelane gade Jewme kenlum swa yiki lie ledeu eh raugai. Khrista au Tinggwang dade gwang nah tinggimgwame, Moses, Joshua, cingku keheibe swade yiki, nah pa rünne ratak cangsiak kecube lie raugai. Keraube ne Jisu au kemau ratak kamtube tei eh Jewme kenlum teicang beu lie eh ranglia gai. Pe tsit cai, Samkak Kehegwabe ratakdung kette teisi me de yidi. Perwak kereieket ga raupwala kecu Samkak Kehegwabe ting ga mipei mipui kenlummedung de, mine teikeherei kebam Khristianmedung de keregui kedige peu auzie nah Tinggwang da kenlum bamlu kera nghabeu auzie.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista-Tinggwang de keulia cangsiak kegaibe (1:1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista-tinggimgwame swa diki (1:4-2:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista-Moses penai Joshua swade diki (3:1-4:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista-cingkube swa diki (4:14-7:28)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista-samkakkelu nah ratak au diki (8:1-10:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Teibam lulo rangkegai (10:19-12:29)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ledeukegai kekambe (13:1-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Nabe au tinggimgwame swa diki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Ndaa Tinggwang caihakecimedung de teu eh pia kekiee ge nah lampui ketsamtsam gade anui paume dage ma rangla. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Dede cudau kekamlebie, Tinggwang pe Na dade anuide ma ranglia dida, pa ma pelane gum kera kedet kelube de. Pe dade, pa kideube de teilu. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Pa au Tinggwang kendu kebaabe nah pe rehi siakte kecube da. Pa pe sam kengkieng le ma pelane de teuncüt pwabam. Pa kemaudung ziemne teimci kedicai, pa kecehu ga Ngkiengtube ba zetle bamdi. <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Pa tinggimgwame swade ngkieng gwadi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggimgwame swade ngkieng gwadi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samgwamedung swa hetwa peukiee gwadi nah kengkieng keteume de pekang gage kaidi.</char></note> pa penui zi swa yigwa kecu zi ge ngaukelu nzwa eh. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Kedanemene Tinggwang samgwame ge dade madauge de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nang au a Na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">henai Ih n Pei dida”?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">Mede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ih pe Pei dizie da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">nah pa a Na dizie da,” de eh rang ni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Hel. 17:13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lei. 2:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Dede, Tinggwang pe neraibe de peu kideu ga lungh gwang keludau, pa ranggai, “Peu Tinggwang samgwame pelane de peu pecu reca lu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 32:43, 1 Pet. 3:22</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Pa tinggimgwame ha ainzwa rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">“Pa au pe samgwame de tingkai tei kebeube,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">nah pe kilame de miheu tei kebeube.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Lei. 104:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Dede Tinggwang Nabe dage ainzwa rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">“Tinggwang, n hegwangbam au kelungta nah kelungta lazie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">N hegwangram tuitie de au kenzeu tuitie ge lie.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Nang kesamsang de kula nah kesia de ngkaula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">Ciziemne Tinggwang, n Tinggwang, suiyi maca dele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">n zangme de swa ncu keniak kiee lu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:7">Lei. 45:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />“Kendeu dau, Rampaubo, nang kideube damgai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">Tinggimdung au n batadung.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 102:25, Ken. 1:1</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Cidung pelane gah dizie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gah dizie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide tinggimdung nah kideu. </char></note>, dede nang au bam jüja zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">Penui au painia ge nzwa sia dizie.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Painia ge nzwa nang cidungde kedip dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">nah cidungde painia ge nzwa kedi dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">Dede nang au lidi lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">nah n teilung madau de penli di lama.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:8">Heb. 13:8</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 102:25-26">Lei. 102:25-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Dede Tinggwang samgwame ge de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">“A ba zetle bamlu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">Ih n ngauraumedung de n pidau bam teilu kemaktane” de eh dai dau rang no?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lei. 110:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 22:44">Mat. 22:44</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Samgwame pelane hegwatei kera, nah kelikelu ngaulu kerame de pierengei kera langkegai rabedung meni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 103:20-21">Lei. 103:20-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Helung peugailo eh mrairang kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Cine anui siukelu de cet mtingsüt gai maisia, iciu eh anui cide gade nreu tetdi melu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Kedanemene tinggimgwame anui paume dage sam rang kegai de kesang lie cai, nah gikahkedi nah samzai teikemak leune saja ngaulu la lie cai, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />kelikelu kedi cikenzwa ge de anui mlai di eh lie cai, dainzwa anui mbai lulai? Kelikelu aide keraibe Rampaube ne reci gaida nah siukelume ne cide kesang lie kecu anui dage rangmci gai beuda. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Tinggwang lie de marehidung, miswakegah, nah kengkieng batadung ketsamtsam gade, nah pe lungning nzwa eh Kemci Rabe mapeu mzi kebeudung gade cide zierang teigai da.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de pe sinamedung nzwa tei kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Kedanemene anui rang kebam de, gwang lai eh kebam kideu de Tinggwang tinggimgwame kangga ge kaima. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Kedanemene kesanglaisiu sauge ga rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">“Nang pe ha cetla kera, mina cide dai no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">Mede mina nabe, nang pe mapie la kera?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Nang pecu tinggimgwame swade tei henah di kak nage ziemne;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">nang pecu kendu nah hetwa kepung peu dida.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Nang ma pelane pe kang gage kaibeu dida.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Kedanemene ma pelane pe kang gage kaibeu kedi gade, pa pe kang gage kaibeu kemakpe magede gah da. Dede cu au anui ma pelane pe kangga kaibeu kedi ngau canglu mereu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Lei. 8:4-6</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:27">1 Cor. 15:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Dede Jisu, tingkak nage ziemne tinggimgwame swa tei henah kedibe de anui ngau, Pe rei nah ketsai ziemne kendu nah hetwa kepung dele hegwangpeurwa cwa teu eh, iciu eh Tinggwang ngaugia gade pelane ziemne pa ketsai msilu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Kedanemene cide pe ziemne petau kedine, pe ziemne au ma pelane lungh bam nah pe dade ma pelane de lungh kebamne, mina kekieege de de kendu gage ngngwa gwang kebeune, pa keherei kegaidung gade penui kelikelu muiteube tei canglu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Kedanemene minadung de penui mau gade tei mci beu kelabe nah tei mci kelume pelane de pe ria ket gade. Makie aide ziemne, pa penuide sinamedung lie qu ngngam meda. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Pa Tinggwang dage rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">“Ih a sinamedung dage n zi rang mdu lia zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">hemaabe kakga de Ih ncu twa zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Lei. 22:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Nah pecai de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">“Ih pecu nlum zie.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:13">Nah pa rang si eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">“Pielo, Ih nah Tinggwang ne acu pwakepeu namedung aika bam.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Isa. 8:17-18</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 12:2">12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Ciziemne, henamedung pumteih nah hejai gade ket tei kebam nzwa, cinzwa eh pade cide ga ngngwa ket teibam, iciu eh petsit gade pa ketsai reu kengkieng kebambe, herakesiabe, de ngkap dilu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:3">Rom. 8:3</ref>, <ref loc="COL 2:15">Col. 2:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Aide aiciu kecu au penui teilung pelane ketsai de hing eh hebaang tei kelame de pa lungmpet beu kerane da. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Kedanemene, tinggimgwame ziemne pa pe lung neibam ma; meliene, Abraham leuhme ziemne pa pe lung neibam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8-10">Isa. 41:8-10</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal. 3:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Cine, pa ma pelane gade de pe sinamedung nzwa maisiadi, iciu eh pa Tinggwang lungningbe nzwa ngaukenggia nah kesamsang cingku kedibe teilu kera ziemne, iciu eh mina maudung gibeu lu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Kedanemene, pa pekatei de keherei gai nah mdakkepie de dau kecu nzwa, pa mdakkepie ga kelame de ngha lubui bam.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Jisu au Moses swade diki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Ciziemne, kemci sinamedung, tinggim gade qu kebam ga nnui kemazi kecumedung. Jisu ha cet gailo, langkegaibe nah cingkupei kedibe lie anui rang kelade. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Pecu kedetgai kebeube dade pa samsang lala, Moses de Tinggwang ki gade samsang kela nzwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Kedanemene pa au Moses swade kendu digwa kecu ngaulu kerabe lie cet luda, ki be swade ki tei kegaibe ne herüt ngau kieegwalu kela nzwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Kedanemene ki keheibe de mige ne au teigai, dede maleune tei kegaibe au Tinggwang. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Kedanemene Moses au Tinggwang ki ga samsang kilame ge tei, pecaine rang kerabe hadung de zierang ge ziemne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Pum. 12:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Dede Khrista au Tinggwang ki pie kerengeibe Nabe nzwa eh samsang. Anui anui kekuu de nah keregui anui hegie bam kelade de kerak ntiprip bam lucai, anui pe ki da.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nlumkemakme dade mriak lulo kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ciziemne, Kemci Rabe rangkegai nzwa eh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">“Henai, magade nnui pe kwa siu cai<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />nnui mlung takdi so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">samzai teirau eh hetaideu gade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">mdakkepie tingdau nzwa.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Cika nnui paume samzai teirau eh acu kedei di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">nah penui a batadung ngauda<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />mmi riakdai ge ziemne. Ciziemne Ih cipau ceheudungde de asui tadi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">Ih ranggai, ‘Penui penui mlung gade tet tsam eh mdeila muila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">nah penui a zaidung cilu tadi.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Cine Ih a rata teu sampet kegai nzwa eh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Penui madaude a kemtak bam ga nlüt lak.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:21-23">Pum. 14:21-23</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 1:34-35">Hez. 1:34-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Sinamedung, iciu eh nnui kakgade migede nlumkemak lungning kesia gede bam mene, ringkela Tinggwang dade nreutetdi melu kera mriak lulo. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Meliene, hangge ge de tingba ramsang kecung eh bamlo, “henai,” de qu kebamtane, iciude cwadi kela kemaudung dene nnui kakga mige lung de tei takdi melu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Kedanemene anui Khrista gu zangna ge dida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zangna ge dida: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anui au rabe gade rikelube de ngngwa ket tei dide. </char></note> magade anui kenlum de raitu gade gwang penli kecang kerak ntipriplu lie cai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29">Pum. 14:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Aipau ha ainzwa ranggai da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">“Henai, magade nnui pe kwa siu lie cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">nnui lung takdi so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">samzai teirau kedi de nzwa.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Lei. 95:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Cine cauge siulu nah mzai tadi no? Moses dade Egypt gade kempet leune meni? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Nah pa caudung ge da mmi riakdai ge pe rata dino? Kemau teikedimedung de meni, hetaideu ga tsai zeu kedime?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29">Pum. 14:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Nah pa caudung dage sampet gai no penui pe mtakbam ga lüt gailak lie kecu, samzai tei kemakmedung dage melie cai?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:24-26">Lei. 106:24-26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Anui penui nlüt gailak kedi ngauda kedanemene penui nlum kemakne.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang minadung ziemne Sabbath-mtak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Ciziemne, pe mtakbam ga lütlu kera sampet de kebam dauge anui ngngi lugo, maige nnui keheibe de cide ga gwangcanglu tadi lu builu. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Cine samliakeyi penuida ranglia kebeu nzwa anuide cinzwa ranglia beuda. Dede penui siukelu sam de penui ziemne ma kemmi gede ma, kedanemene penui cide kenlum gade siukegai leune de ngngwa ket teilu kemakne. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Kedanemene anui nlumkelume kemtakni cika lüt, pa rangkegai nzwa eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">“Ih a lunghop gade sampetkegai nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">Penui madaude a kemtakni ga nlüt lak.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:3">Iciuliede, pe batadung au kideu tei kelu benai gade tei canglu. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Kedanemene kesanglaisiu ga pa lang hena ne benai ha rang gaida:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:4">“Nah Tinggwang pe bata leune gade lang hena ne benai mtaklu.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Nah aipau samde gage ranggai dai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:5">“Penui madaude a mtakni ga nlüt lak.”<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Ciziemne, midungge cika nlütlu kera bamreu, nah pedwa samliakeyi de penui dage ranglia beu eh siu kelumedung nlütlu ma, kedanemene penui samzai tei kemakne. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />“Henai” de cide qu kegai Tinggwang tingba ge riep dailu. Tingbazie kekiee ge cai, pa David dade ranggai, pedwa rangkedi nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">“Henai nnui pe kwa siu lie cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">nnui lung takdi so.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Lei. 95:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Kedanemene Joshua ne penuide kemtak peunzeu lie cai, Tinggwang tingba keda ge ha aipaucai de rangbam laklu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Hez. 31:7</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Jos. 22:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Cine Tinggwang minadung ziemne Sabbath mtak ge kainzeu pwabam reu. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Kedanemene Tinggwang mtakni ga nlüt kelu keheibe liede pe batadung gade mtaklu, Tinggwang pe bata gade mtak kelu nzwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 14:13, Ken. 2:2</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Ciziemne anui cipau kemtak de ga lütlu kerane laikai tei lugo, iciu eh migede samzai tei kemak cikenzwa ga kaudi melu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:1">Heb. 4:1</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 1:10-11">1 Pet. 1:10-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Kedanemene Tinggwang sam au kering nah kengkieng bam nah kiengtie pemui lule ailam ketei swade yiki. Cide kuipwa teu lampak dila keringria nah rabe de, miking nah misiedung de, nah mikecet nah milung ga cet kebam ci lula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:29">Jer. 23:29</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 55:11">Isa. 55:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Damkegaidung magede Tinggwang dwade kebai kedi gah. Meliene, pe dage anui ta liagai kerabe dwade magede kebaidi gailak nah ma pelane ngau mcigi bam.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu cingku kedibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Ciziemne, Jisu Tinggwang Nabe, tinggim leune kahkegwangbe cingku kedibe anuida kebam ne, anui kenlum de ga kerak ntiprip bam lugo. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Kedanemene anui kemneidung ziemne ngaunggia gai kelakbe cingkupei kedibe anuida bam ma, dede ma pelane gade anuide nzwa kedei kecube ge bam, dede kemau tei ma. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Anui kuu eh ngaugia Tinggwang hegwangbam ga tetgai cugo, iciu eh anui ngaugia ngaulu kerane nah ngaugia peeilu eh anui teu maikesia tingdau nghalu kerane.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Cingku kedi keheibe de, mina kakgade kedet kelude au, mina mteina keleu tei eh Tinggwang ta tei kerane nlumbeu dida, iciu eh pa mapeudung pwapeu nah kemau ratakdung teilu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Pa maci kemakmedung nah cwateu kedimedung dade nciep lubui, kedanemene pa pekatei de mnei kebamne. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Aide ziemne, pa kemaudung ziemne ratak teime gailak di, pa mina ziemne ketei nzwa, pe ziemne de tei maisiadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:6">Lev. 16:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Migede hetwakepung Cingku kedibe tei kera pekatei kedet lama. Meliene, Tinggwang ne Aaron de qukelu nzwa pecu de qu kelube.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Tet. 28:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Cide nzwa eh, Khrista de pekatei pecu cingku kedibe tei eh hetwa peu ma. Meliene, pecu resiu kebambe rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">“Nang au a Na;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">henai Ih n Pei dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lei. 2:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Kesanglaisiu ga pesau kedadung gade de Tinggwang rangkegai nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">“Melchizedek cai pwa eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">Nang au kelungta cingkume ge.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Jisu kideu ga kelungh dau, pa pe miakdui lwa nah sahbak eh kekie tei nah pe ngia teu delwe pecu ketsai gade kelilu kebuibe da gwang, nah pa au henah nah masang kecune pe kwa kingnei beu. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Pa au Tinggwang nabe liede, pa keherei kegai gade samzai teilu. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Pecu yicangsiak kelube teilu, nah keheibe de pe samzai tei kelume ziemne pa kelungta kelikelu lampuibe teidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:17">Isa. 45:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Tinggwang pecu peu Melchizedek pa pwa leu eh cingku kedibe tei kera nlumbeu dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:10">Heb. 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Lei. 110:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaudi helo eh rangmriak kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Anui aide ga maha rangsüt kera bam, dede cide rang mcigai kera teipa lie, kedanemene nnui kingnei kecu ga mang kedine. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Ciziemne nnui aipau tingdau keledeume ge teiladi kerabe dida, dede nnuide au mikangge ne Tinggwang samdung pendeube gade nnui dage ledeu kerame ge teu maisia zeu reu. Nnui au taktyei kengkingbe meliene tungdui teu maisia kecume tei dida! <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Kedanemene keheibe de tungdui rünne sak lacai pa au kesamsang sam de cicang mereu, kedanemene pa au hename ge zeureu kecune. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Dede taktyei kengkiengbe au kengkiengme ziemne, penui zai reli gade keyi nah kesia ci ntsamlu kebui keteu luda.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Anui Khrista sam kenciep nabedung gidi eh kengkiengbe ga gwang cugo. Anui ketsai batadung gade helungkenreu nah Tinggwang de kenlum ha bangdwa kedage dwa dai bui ma, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />duipum ha keledeu, heba hwa kegai ha, ketsaime ringcuh daikera ha, nah kelungta kemmau ha gede. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Aide anuide tei zie Tinggwang tei lulo beu cai. <verse eid="HEB 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Kedanemene piage kesangbe ha ci kelume ziemne au helung nreu dai kera au pazu dida, tinggim mapeu msi kedime nah Kemci Rabe de kemazi kedime, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />nah Tinggwang sam keyi msi kedime nah gwang kera teilung kengkieng ha ci kelume, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />dede penui kaudi cai, cipaume dungde de helungkenreu gage ngngwagwang gaidai kera au pazu dida. Kedanemene Tinggwang Nabe de penuikatei penui ziemne gwak nah pecu mteibe dwa gage hengam tei daidi delu. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Hangdeu tingrui kegaidau sak kelabe, nah hangdeu cide hetatah kegaibe ziemne mabangdung keyi lungbeu la kelabe, Tinggwang dade samlam ngau lula. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Dede hangdeu hetubangdung nah petu ketei heidung lungh kecube au pemi gah nah reset dilu kebui ge dida. Cide kekamle rudi kera da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:6">Jhn. 15:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Dede kehungmedung, anui ainzwa rangbam liede, nnui ziemne makeyi bam kera anui nlum bam, kelikelu ngau kera de ga. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Kedanemene Tinggwang au petaukemak tei lama, nang n bata tei kegai nah pe zi ziemne keku keulia kegai, kemcime de nkwet kelu nah cude nkwet kebamdungde pa nsungta di lak. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Anui hengin kebam au nnui ket ket kecude peu nnui suiyi eh penli ga cang luneu, iciu eh nnui keregui peu bambilu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Aide ai nnuide peu nghetdi melu kerane, dede kenlum nah helungketie teu eh sampet keludung gum kelume nzwalu kerane.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang sampet au kesang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Tinggwang Abraham dage samkai kebeu dau,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sampet kebeu dau: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa pecu samlam beuzie, nah pe leuhme tinggim ga hegidung nzwa lunghing luzie.</char></note> pa mi pe swa kedi kedage de teu sampet kera kegah ne, pa pekatei pecu teu sampet. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Pa rangdi, “Ih ncu samlambeu bizie, nah Ih n leuhme tei ngkiee beuzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Ken. 22:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Ainzwa eh, Abraham pe lungtie eh lia lwe samkai kebeude pa ngaulu. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Mina pekatei peswa diki kecume ge de teu sampet la. Penui kakga kehebwak de au, sampet kelude ne ma tei mdui lula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:11">Tet. 22:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Tinggwang samkai kebeude ngaulu kerame dage pa riemteu kelade madauge de pe lungningbe li dilak lie rang mci lia kera cet keludau, pa cide teibi kera sampetgai si beu. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Cine Tinggwang pe sam kaibeu nah sampet de gaibeu da. Makie kena aide lidi lama kedanemene Tinggwang au mret dila melu. Ciziemne, anui pe dage msiu kerane pakgai kelume, anui dwaga kebam keregui de kerak ntip bamlu kera tei ngkuu süt gai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Hez. 19:15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat. 18:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Anui keregui kebam aide au keringria ziemne ntip nah nlumlu kebui liemgeukang kenzwa ge, cide tiggim ga kerecaki pailim helungle de lütlu kelabe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Pum. 23:19</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 2:13">1 Tim. 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />cika Jisu, anui dwa gwang kedibe, anui keleu tei delwe heni cide ga lüt. Melchizedek cai pwa eh pa kelungta cingku kedibe teibam dida.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Cingkupei Melchizedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Aide ziemne Melchizedek, Salem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Salem:</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Salem pekie lungciep; Samtie aide Jerusalem de rangbam de lubui.</char></note> gwangpei, cehutube Tinggwang cingkube, Abraham hegwangmedung de renialwe cailigwang keladau pecu redaulu delwe pecu samlambeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Ken. 14:17-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Abraham pecu ma pelane zikerei zige pwapeu. Pe zi pekie au “kesamsang hegwangpei,” nah pecai “Salem gwangpei,” de da, cide pekie, “kezuyi gwangpei.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Pa au pe pei, pe pui, paupak ha gede gah, teilung tingbazie pe ndeube de gah mede pe teilung cangkedi ha de gah. Meliene, Tinggwang Nabe nzwa, pa kelungta cingkupei ge teibam di.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Dede mina aide daihia gede dibi pie gailo, heleuh peibe Abraham pe dage hereu ketei gade keu keludung pa zikerei zige pwa pecu peu. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Nah kesang Levi leuhmedung cidungde cingku teikelume Israelme dade zikerei zige keu hekwa kera hezaibe rehi gade aja ge kainzeu, cide penui sinamedung dade de keuzie, penui Abraham leuhme gade lunghgwang kelume ge liede.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Pum. 18:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Melchizedek penui dade lungh kegwangme ge ma, dede Abraham dade zikerei zige luulu nah pecu samlam beu, Tinggwang samkai kebeu ngaukelube de. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Samlam kebeube au samlam luu kelube swa diki kecu mcigi bam. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Aipau ria gade liecai, tsaidi kelame ne zikerei zige de luula, dede cipau rehi gade liecai, Melchizedek ringla kelabe ne luula. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Nah, kerang zai gade liecai, Levi, zikerei zige luu kelabe de, Abraham dade zikerei zige Melchizedek de peudi delie lubui, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />kedanemene, Abraham Melchizedek de redau kecu dau, Levi au pe paume pumga lareu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:18-20">Ken. 14:18-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu au Melchizedek nzwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Cine magade Levime cingkuta gade yicangsiak kecu ngau lula liecai (kedanemene cipau kang gade mina hezaibe ngau kelune), daitei eh Melchizedek pa pwa leu kera cingku kedage cika pet si laino, nah Aaron ria gade mene? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Kedanemene cingku keteime releu dige, hezaibe de teili maisiadi kecu teila. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Kedanemene cu pe ha rang kebambe de au heleuh kedage gade, cipau leuh gade migede madaude recabam ga hegwa teima. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Kedanemene, anui Rampaube au Judah leuh gade lunghgwang kecu cide mcigi da, cipau leuh de gade cingkume ha Moses kette rangnzeu ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:10">Ken. 49:10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa. 11:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Nah aide au mci gwa dida, Melchizedek kenzwa cingku kedage cuhdai cai. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Pa pumteihbe zai gade ma, dede tei msiadi gaikelak teilung kengkieng gade cingkupei ge tei dida. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Kedanemene kesanglaisiu ga pe ha rangkenzeu au:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:17">“Melchizedek pa pwa leu eh nang au kelungta cingkupei ge dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:10">Lei. 104:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Hezai keraibe de keumpet ntsam dida kedanemene cide kemnei ge nah kemta ge kedi ziemne, <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />(kedanemene hezaibe magede tei hemi cangsiak beuma), nah keregui yigwa kecuge teugwang luda, iciu eh cika de anui Tinggwang da nna gwanglu da. <verse eid="HEB 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Nah aide sampet tei mene teigai ma! Kedanemene mi kedame au sampet tei mene cingkume teilu, <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />dede Jisu au sampet teilwe cingku ge teilu, kedanemene Tinggwang pe dage ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">“Rampaube sampet tei luda nah pa pe lungnreu dilak:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Nang au kelungta cingku ge dida.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Lei. 110:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Cide kesiakge, Jisu samkak yiki kecuge teibi kera teibeu. <verse eid="HEB 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Cingku keraibedung au kekiee ge, kedanemene penuide ketsai ne kaamdi eh penui ta tei jüja bam luma. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Dede Jisu au kelungta lungh kela ziemne, pa au cingkupei tei eh bammui la. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ciziemne pe dade Tinggwang da gwang kelume cipaume de pa kelilu bui, kedanemene pa penui ziemne kie kera ring bammui la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:1-2">1 Jhn. 2:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 2:5">1 Tim. 2:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Cine cikenzwa cingkupei kedibe au anui ziemne zeutube kesang delie. Pa au kemcibe, kemau gah, mcigi, kemaume dade teu ntsam kelube, nah tinggimdung swade pa cehuki kecube dida. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Pa au cingkupei kedibe kedamedung nzwa tingba ramsangne, keraibe pemau ziemne nah pecaide mina mau ziemne, ratak tei maisia ma. Kedanemene pa pekatei pe pum kaibeu dau, pelane ziemne piage gage tei beudi delu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:6">Lev. 16:6</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 10:10">Heb. 10:10</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 10:12">12</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 10:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Moses zaibe gade au mina kemneimedung de cingkupei kedibedung tei kera kedet lula. Dede sampetkelu sam, hezaibe caine gwangkelu, Nabe de kedetlu, pecule pwa kelungta yicangsiak kelube teilu.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Samkakkelu keheci cingku kedibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Cu anui rangkebam kiede aide da: Anuida cingkupei kedibe ge bam, Tinggim ga kengkieng hegwangbam zetle bie kebambe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lei. 110:1</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 10:12">Heb. 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Mina ne mene Rampaube ne tei kelu kemci ni, paiki kesangbe de ga pa kilame ge tei bam. <verse eid="HEB 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Cingku kedibe keheibe de mapeudung nah ratakdung reca beu kerane kedet pwabam. Ciziemne aipaude liede pa mapeu peulu kera mage au bam maisiabi. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Khrista kideu ga bamcai, pa au cingkume ge daulak zing, kedanemene hezaibe de mzui eh mapeudung pwa kepeume cika bamlu. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Penui au tinggim keracaki rehi nah cide mie kenzwa ge ta tei. Moses paiki teicuh lai eh kebam dau, Tinggwang pecu rangmriak gai, “Pie lulo, lamlwa gade ncu keulia kecu de nzwa eh ma keheibe de tei lu maisia.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Tet. 25:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Dede cu au Jisu heta yigwa kecuge ngau luda, sampet yiki kecu gage bangdwa teikelu, pa samkak yiki kecu ga hekak ketetbe kecu nzwa. <verse eid="HEB 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Kedanemene samkakkelu keraibe ga kemau gah liecai, samkakkelu pe kenabe bam mede yilu bui. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Tinggwang penui mau ngau keludau, pa rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">“Ainie, Rampaube rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">Ih Israel kilungme nah Judah kilungme de ngngwa samkak keheci ge tei kera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">tingbaziedung gwang lada.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Ih penui ba teu delwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">penuide Egyptme deu gade ngngwa mpet kelu benai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">penui paume de Ih ngngwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">samkak tei kelu de nzwa lakta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Penui a samkak ga la takedi ziemne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">nah Ih penuide sipei tadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">de eh Rampaube rangla.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Cipau tingbaziedung caine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Ih Israel kilungme de ngngwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Samkak tei kera aide da</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">de eh Rampaube rangla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Ih a zaidung penui lung gage kai beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">nah Ih penui mlung gage cidungde rau dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Ih penui Tinggwang dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">nah penui a minadung dizie.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Penui hangge ge kecu pe kidame de ledeu dilak</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">nah hangge ge kecu pe sinabe de, ‘Rampaube de cilu,’ de eh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">Kedanemene penui pelane acu ci luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">penui ceutube gade gwang ditube kecangde.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Kedanemene Ih penui bata kesiadung de ngaunggia beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">nah Ih penui maudung madaude nsung bamsi lakta.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Samkakkelu aide de “keheci,” de qulu eh, pa samkakkelu keraide luuta kedi teidi, nah luuta kedi de hegwadi eh gah zette dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer. 31:31-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Kideube paiki gade kereca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Samkakkelu keraibe de kereca ziemne nah kideu gu heni kemci ge ziemne hezaidung bam. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Recapaiki ge teilu. Keraibe bung ga, mitaubam, taktyeibam, nah tei mci kelu tangku bam, cide de kemci ni lie qula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Tet. 25:23-30</ref>;<ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">26:1-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Kehezu pai pe kenabe caiga kibung kedage bam, cide de kemci nidung kakgade mcitube lie qula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Tet. 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Cika marim kehengui keru ziemne kecak recabam ge bam. Samkakbung kecak le cumkelu bung gede bam. Cipau lungga manna kai kenzeu kecakbung de, Aaron tuitie penei bwapet kedide, nah samkakkelu tangtsu kwak de bam. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Samkakbung peuga cherubim kendu ne ratak tei kebeude gumpwa bam. Cipaude ha cu rangsiakte kera peting mereu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Tet. 25:18-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Ma aidungde mtei kelu cai, cingkumedung penui ta tei kerane paiki hegwabe bung ga lütbam muila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:21">Hez. 27:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Dede kibung pe kenabe ga cingkupei kedibe rünne mmi ge gade piage lütla, nah pa pekatei pe ziemne nah pe minadung ci mene teimau keladung ziemne hejai teu mene reca tei lama. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Hegwabe paiki keraide kebamtane heni mcitube dega kelüt lampui ngaulu mereu lie de Kemci Rabe keulia gai. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Aide cudau ting rehi ge, cika mapeudungde nah ratakdung pwa kereca de le kerecame lung tei mnung gai kelak ge. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Cidungde au ketyei kesak, mide tei mci kela zaidung ge rünne, ma tei keheci dai kecu ting gwang cang kemak tane, mipumteibe ziemne riet teu kela hezaidung ge.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista jai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Dede Khrista au ma keyidung gwangkelu gu cingkupei kedibe tei eh gwang. Pa mina ba ne tei kemak paiki diki nah yiki kecu ga lwet, cide au kideu dam kelu gude ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">Khrista ma keyibedung gwang kera cingku kedibe tei eh gwang, de eh peila. </char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Pa piage gage pelane ziemne heni mcitube ga lüt dida, hemeu nah ketumnadung jai teu mene, dede pekatei pe jai le, kelungta rikelu ngau luda. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Kedanemene hemeu nah ketumseudung jai nah ketumna keru mimütdung mci kemakmedung reu gage kezin gai eh penui pumteih tei mcilu kerane penuide Tinggwang dage tei mcilu cai, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Khrista jai au daikenzwa gede yiki zieno? Pa kelungta Rabe gade mci cang eh kemau gah eh pekatei pecu pwa Tinggwang dage ratak teigai, ketsai tadung gade anui lungcet <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">nnui </char> de mene <char style="fqa">anui </char> de bam.</note> teimci beu eh anui ringkela Tinggwang gwa teilu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Aipau kiede ziemne, Khrista au samkakkelu kehecibe ga hekak ketetbe da,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Tim. 2:5</char></note> ciu eh qu kelumedung kelungta samkai kebeu de gumlu kera ngau luzie, kedanemene Khrista tsai kebeu gade samkakkelu keraibe kangga kelame kemau tei kedidung de de rilu delu. <verse eid="HEB 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Kedanemene samkakkelu ga pesam pet kegaibe tsai de gai maisia kedine. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Kedanemene pe sam pet kegaibe ring kebamtane cide magede ma, tsai kedicaine cide peta tei la. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Cine samkakkelu keraibe de hejai teu mene tei ma. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Kedanemene Moses mina pelane dage hezai ga aja pelane rang kebeu dau, pa ketumnadung nah hemeudung jai keulu, dui nah pai giereba nah hyssop teu eh laisiudum reu gage nah mina pelane de de kezinlwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:4">Lev. 14:4</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 19:6">Pum. 19:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Ge Moses rangdi, “Aide Tinggwang ne nnuide aja kaikebeu Samkakkelu jai deda.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Tet. 24:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Cide kesiakke, pa hejai pwa kereca paiki nah kereca dau teukela lidung pelane gage kezin lwagai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lev. 8:15</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 8:19">19</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Hezaibe rehi gade, ma pelane de hejai le tei mcilu, nah hejai lwagai mai kemau gilu kera gede gah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Lev. 17:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Ciziemne tinggim gu rengeidung de au aidungde le teu teimci maisiadi. Iciuliede, tinggim gudung au cidungde swa yiki kecu ratak teu tei mci maisia di. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Kedanemene Khrista au heba le teikelu heni mcitube ga lüt ma, cide au kesangbe rengei ge rünne. Meliene pa tinggim ga, anui ding tei eh Tinggwang dwaga lüt dida. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Cingku kedibe mmi ramsang pekatei hejai keda teulwe heni mcitube ga lütdai kela nzwa, Khrista cika pia kekiee ge lüt pecu kaipwa peudai kecu teima. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Iciu cai, pa kideu damkelu gade pia kekiee ge keherei bamzie. Dede cu au pa piage gage peting penli lebie pekatei pecu pwa ratak tei gai kemau keugilu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Mina de peu piage tsai eh pecai tutiak ga gwang kera riem kebeu nzwa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Cor. 5:10</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 12:14">Kel. 12:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />cide nzwa, Khrista de piage mina kekiee maudung gibeu zielie pe pum kaibeu, delwe pia pe kenabe gwang daizie, kemau ha ziemne ma, dede pecu regui eh kwa kebamme de kelilu kera ziemne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet. 2:24</ref>, <ref loc="TIT 2:13">Tit. 2:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s">Khrista pelane ziemne piage gage ratak tei kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Kedanemene hezaibe au<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 5:17</char></note> ma keyibe gwang kera mie ge rünne ge, cipau dungde kesangbe rehidung ma. Cingkumedung ne mmi ge cai mmi ge eh gwang ratak keteide tei jüja eh Tinggwang da gwang kelame madaude yicang gailak. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Iciu lubui liecai, ratak tei kelade mtakdi lak lui ni? Kedanemene kerecamedung de piage teimci di lubui nah kemau kecet gede bamsi lakta. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Dede ratak cidungde gade mmi ge cai mmi ge eh minadung de peu kemaudung nsung hecidai lula. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Kedanemene hemeu nah ketum jaidung ne kemaudung keugi gailak lu. <verse eid="HEB 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Cine Khrista kideu ga gwang keludau, pa Tinggwang da rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">“Ratakdung nah recadung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">nang luuneu lama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">dede nang pumbe a ziemne mtei pwala;<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />keru ratakdung nah kemau ratakdung de</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nang nsui lama.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Pecai Ih ranggai, ‘Ainie, Ih aika bam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">N lungningbe tei kera, O Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">laisiudum ga a ha rauteu kela nzwa.’”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Keraibe Khrista Tinggwang dage ranggai, “Nang ratakdung nah recadung, nah keru ratak pelane nah kemau ratakdung luuneu lama. Mede nang cidungde ga nsui lama.” (cidungde hezaibe ga nzwa ratak teigai beula), <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />cidau pa rangdi, “Pielo, Ih aika bam n lungningbe tei kera.” Pa pe kenabe de teilu kerane tei kebam keraibe de keugi dida. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Cipau lungning de gade, Jisu Khrista pelane ziemne piage gage pe pum kai kebeu gade anuide tei mci luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:14">Heb. 10:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Nah kesang cingku keheibe de tingnai ramsangne sap eh Tinggwang dage pe ta tei gaila. Pa ratakdung tei kedibe teidai dai gaila, madaude kemaudung keugi gaikelak ratakdung de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Tet. 29:38</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 29:39">39</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Dede Khrista kemaudung ziemne kelungta ratak ket tei kegai dau, pa Tinggwang ba zetle bam dida. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Cipau ting gade, pa pe ngauraumedung de pe pidau teidi kemaktane kwabam dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lei. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Kedanemene piage reca tei kegai gade pa tei mci kelumedung de kelungta tei mmi cangsiak beudi delu. <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Nah Kemci Rabe de anui dage zierang tei gaila. Keraibe pa rangdi,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Ih cipau tingbadung cai penuide ngngwa samkak tei kera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">aide da, de eh Rampaube rangla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Ih penui mlung gage a zaidung kai beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">nah Ih penui lung gage cidungde raugai beu zie.” <verse eid="HEB 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Nah pecai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">“Penui maudung nah penui ta kesiadung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">Ih nsung silak da.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 8:12">Heb. 8:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer. 31:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Kemaudung ziemne kemaugi kedi ga, kemau ratak gede teigai kera bamsi meda.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lia lulo eh qukegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Ciziemne, sinamedung, Jisu jai gade anui heni mcitube ga lütlu kera kenlum bam dida. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Pa anui ziemne lampui keheci nah kering lampui ge ngkei beu kehezupai de gika eh, cide au, pe pumbe gade. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Anui cingku kedi ge Tinggwang kerecaki ga bam kecune, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />anui mlung masang tei eh nlum cangsiak eh, lungcet kesia gade anui mlung tei mcilu nah anui pumdung dui kemci le huilu eh gwang lugo. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Anui lunghaudi mene rangkela anui kereguide ntiprip eh kaizeu lugo, kedanemene Tinggwang, sam kaikebeube, au masanglu. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Nah anui kereku nah makeyi tei eh hangge gede dainzwa kecung eh bi cet lugo. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Midung ge nzwa, anui kangbau eh ngkwa bam kelade mtakdi helo. Meliene, anui hangge gede teingkuu si lugo, pe tingba de gwang nna reu reu kebamde ngau eh.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Kedanemene anui kesangbe maci de ngaukelu caide kemau teidai dai bamcai, kemaudung ziemne ratak teisi kera gede bam meda. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Meliene, tutiak ga gwang kera kehing de nah Tinggwang ngauraume de miheu cisüt kecu gage ngkapdi kerade rünne delie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa. 26:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Keheibe de Moses zai gileu kedime de ngaugia gede si mene mi hangna mede hangcum zierang gade tsai dila. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Nnui kecet gade Tinggwang Nabe de pe pidau tei kedibe de nah samkakkelu jai de, cide ne pecu tei mci kelude de, hera lie kelabe, nah ngaugia Rabe de kii kelabe de, dai kenzwa saja kesia gede peu maisia no?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:25">Heb. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Kedanemene anui sam aide kerangbe de ci, “Hekum kepei au agu; Ih cide rui daibeu zie.” Nah pecaide, “Rampaube ne pe minadung tutiak zie.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Ringkela Tinggwang ba gage kaugai kera au ngngisüt kecuge.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Dede gwangkedi tingbaziedung de nsung lulo, cide gade, nnui kebaa ngau kelucai, nnui kehereisüt kecuge lia luda. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Nnuide madauge mtei dwade de kii nah teikeherei, nah keda tingdau ainzwa teikeherei kecume de nnui ngngwa ket tei eh gwang. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Kedanemene nnui hebaangme de ngaunggia beu, nah nnui guniadung sütteu kedide nnui suiyi ngga eh luulu. Nnui mabam yiki nah kelungta bam kera mabam bamlie kecu nnui ci kecune.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga</char><char style="fqa">kedanemene nnui Ih hebaang keteidau acu ngau ngaunggia beu, de bam</char>. </note> <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Cine nnui kekuu de gidi so, cika ziehi kedige bam. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Kedanemene nnui helungketiede teu maisia, iciu eh nnui Tinggwang lungningbe tei kelucai, pa sampet kebeu de nnui ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="HEB 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Kesanglaisiu ga rang kela nzwa, “Peting tie mene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">gwanglai eh kebambe gwang zie nah ri dilak.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Dede kesamsang a minadung au kenlum gade ring luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">nah pa nlidai dicai, Ih pecu a sui tadi zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab. 2:4</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 3:11">Gal. 3:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Dede anui au kengkap gage nlidai kedimedung ma. Meliene, anui au kenlum bam eh keringria de peu kwaklu keramedung da.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Kenlum gade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Cu kenlum au regui keladungde ngau bilu kera deda nah ngaula kemakdung de ci mci lu kera deda. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Kedanemene penui kenlumde ziemne ndaa anui paume hezi keyi ngaulu. <verse eid="HEB 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Anui kenlum gade Tinggwang samle kideu damlu dilie kecu ci lula, iciu eh anui cu kengaube au ngau kecudung gade teilu ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Ken. 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Lei. 33:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Kenlum gade Abel au Cain swade ratak yiki kecu pwa Tinggwang de peu, cide gade pa masang lie kecu keulialu, nah pe mapeu ziemne Tinggwang pe keyi ha ranggai, nah pa tsaidi liede, kenlum gade pa cude zierang teibam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-5">Ken. 4:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Kenlum gade Enoch de ngngwa nghangdi cine pa ketsai ngau ma. “Tinggwang pecu keuteu kedine, pecu ngaulu tadi.” Kedanemene pecu ngngwa nghang kedidwa, pa Tinggwang suiyi teilu delie kecu zierang ngaulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Ken. 5:21-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Kenlum si mene pe suiyi tei gailak. Kedanemene Tinggwang da kegwangme pa lunghla lie kecu nah pa au pecu peei kelame ziehi teibeu kelabe lie kecu nlumlu maisia. <verse eid="HEB 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Noah kenlum gade, Tinggwang ne mrai rangkebeu sam de ngau mereu liede, rabe de kerüt gade pe kilungme de kelilu kerane liem ge teilu. Aide ketei gade, pa kideube de mmaudi nah kenlum gade kegwang kesamsang mapwame ge teidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Ken. 6:13-22</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Abraham kenlum gade, pecu qu kegai dau, samzai teilu nah peu gum zielie eh pa ngaululai eh kebam heni dega tetmie. Pa daiga mielabi kecu cimene, pa tetmie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Ken. 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Kenlum gade pa sampet kebeu deu ga sangme ge tei eh lungh. Pa paiki ga Isaac penai Jacob, sampet kebeu mapwabe kenade de ngngwa lungh. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Kedanemene pa au namdi bangdwabe, Tinggwang ne riem nah tei kegai de regui bam. <verse eid="HEB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Kenlum gade, Sarah liede hena ge tetlaklu kebui kengkieng ngaulu, pa kecing sütdi liede, sampet kebeube de pa masang lie eh nlum kelune. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ciziemne, aipau peide dade de, nah pa tsai nage di liede, ting ga hegidung kieege, nah jaaidikung ga heciang peikap gaikelak kieege heleuhdung lunghlu. <verse eid="HEB 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Mina aidung pelane sampet kebeude ngaulu mene kenlum gade tsai dida, meliene penuide kemdei gade piegai nah kelum kegai, nah penui au sangmedung lie kecu nah kideu ga penui ki kegahmedung lie rangdi. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Kedanemene sam cikenzwadung kerangme penui ki kesang ge peeila liekecu cide rang mcigai. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Magade penui tetkahmpet kedibe deudi hade penui mning daila kesang liecai, penui cailigwang dailu kera ziuyi de ngau luzie nage. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Dede cinzwa eh, penui deudi yiki kecuge hengin ladi, cide au, tinggim ram. Ciziemne Tinggwang au penui Tinggwang lie qu kecu ngngam dima, pa penui ziemne namdi ge mtei pwabam kedine. <verse eid="HEB 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Kenlum gade Abraham, pecu kedei kecudau, Isaac de ratak tei pwapeu. Sampet kebeudung pa ngau kelube liede pe na kepumlibe de pwapeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-10">Ken. 22:1-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Tinggwang pe dage ranggai, “Isaac dade n leuhmedung zi msiak zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Ken. 21:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Abraham au Tinggwang Isaac de ketsai gade de kwakcuh dailu kera nlum, nah samgwa nzwa, pa cikade pecu ngau dailu. <verse eid="HEB 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Kenlum gade, pecaine gwang keradung ziemne de, Isaac ne Jacob nah Esau de samlam beu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-40">Ken. 27:27-40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Kenlum gade Jacob, pa tsaidi lai kecudau, Joseph napeidung ketket kecude samlambeu, nah pe tuitie reuga ngngeilwe, recagai. <verse eid="HEB 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Kenlum gade Joseph, pe teilungzie canggwang kecudau, Israel napeidung de Egypt gade ngngwampet kera rang nah pe radung keu eh teimai kesiadung penuide ranglia beu. <verse eid="HEB 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Kenlum gade Moses, pecu mna keludau, pe pui pe pei ne pecu keicum ge kebaidi kedanemene pa au hezukeyi hena nage kecu penai ngau kelune, nah penai au hegwangpei aja de hing tadi. <verse eid="HEB 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Kenlum gade Moses, pa ngkiengcuh kelucai, Pharaoh napui napei lie qukera raudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11">Tet. 2:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Meliene, pa Tinggwang minadung de ngngwa keherei kecube kedetlu, kemau tei eh tingkakge kehega kecube swade. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Pa Egypt ga maheidung swade Khrista ziemne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khrista ziemne </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide pekie Kelikelube gwang kera pe kenlumde ziemne ngngam kera cetlu. </char></note> ngngam kelube diki kecu cetlu. Kedanemene pa au pe ziehi gage pe miak kaiteu kelane. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Kenlum gade Moses Egypt pütdi. Pa hegwangpei rata de hing tadi, kedanemene pa ngau kemak Tinggwang de kengau nzwa eh pa lia kelune. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Kenlum gade pa Kahkegwangngyi de nah hejai kehezin de teilu, iciu eh neraibe de tei kengkapbe penuide deumelu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-29">Tet. 12:21-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Kenlum gade Israelme Jaaidi Kegie de deucangh deu nzwa eh tetkah mpetlu. Egyptmedung aide tei zielie tei kecudau, penuide kegak cetdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Tet. 14:21-31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Kenlum gade Jericho tsukwadung de kaumie di, Israelme lang henane tet twagwa kelu caine. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Kenlum gade helipui Rahab samzai tei kemakmedung de ngngwa tsai dima, kedanemene pa reketmedung de kezuyi gade ngngwa kelune. <verse eid="HEB 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Ih daipai rangsi lai? Kedanemene Ih Gideon, Barak, Samson, Jephthah, David nah Samuel de si eh nah caihakecimedung ha rang bamcai a ziemne peting gahdi zieda. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Kenlum gade penui hegwangramdung gwalu, kemzuibe teilu, nah sampetdung ngaulu. Penui hinghodung mui kaamlu, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />miheu kengkieng teimmüt lu, tsaidilu kera gade paklu, teeineidung gade teingkeilu, hereu gade ngkienglu nah sangme reugwame de ngamlu. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Kenlum gade mipuidung penui kibaume tsaikedime de ngau dailu ketsai gade kwakcuh lu eh. Dede kedame dungde teikeherei, lungkempet de luuneu mene, iciu eh penui yiki kecuga ringcuh lu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Nah kedamedung de kedei eh henui tei nah dap, nah hegeuria le kang nah hebaang de tei. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Penuide tangtsu sam, penuide dumtüt kena teidi, penuide kedei, penuide kiengtie le bitset. Penui meurün nah hemeu geudung bah eh rwapwa, magede gah eh, mine mneu nah teikeherei. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Kideube penui ziemne yilu tadi. Penui kideu ketsaidung ga nah lamlwadung, nah tsupopdung ga nah hangdeu ketiet kidung ga huirwa ladi. <verse eid="HEB 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Mina aidung pelane penui kenlum ziemne hezi keyi ngaulu, dede penui Tinggwang sampet kebeude ngau luma. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Tinggwang anui ziemne ma yiki kecuge riem teula, iciu eh anuide si mene, penuide tei mmi cangsiak melu kerane.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang pe name de keledeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Zierang hemwa kedige anuide twagwapung eh anuida bam kecune, anui hepüt kerüt leune nah kangpwa kebam kemaudung keugi digo. Anui dwaga kebam hezu kemzude kaipwa kebamde lia eh pak lugo. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Anui Jisu de pie lugo, kenlum bangdwabe nah tei cangsiak beu kelabe de. Pe dwaga suiyibe kebamde ziemne, pa cross de lialu, hengam ketei cide sipei ma, nah Tinggwang hegwangbam zetlebie bam dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:23-24">1 Pet. 2:23-24</ref>, <ref loc="TIT 2:13-14">Tit. 2:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Cine pe ha cet gailo, kemaume dade cauge lialu dibi ngaurau süt kecu pekatei renia eh, iciu eh peu nnuide nnui lung kehereidi melu kerane nah pütdi melu kerane.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Nnui kemau de ngngwa renia eh, hejai lwacu kecang tei mereu. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Nah nnui nsungta dida kecung kegaide ga pe namedung lie de nnuide qu kelade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">“A na, Rampaube ledeu kegaide cetnla diso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">mede pane nnuide ledeu kecudau leu diso.”<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Kedanemene Rampaube pa hung kelame de ledeu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">nah pa pe na lie eh luu kelume leune de saja peula.<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Nnui keherei aide liagwang kecudau, Tinggwang pe name de nzwa nnuide ledeu bamlie kecu nsunglu. Kedanemene pe pei ne ledeu kemak cau bamno? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Magade Tinggwang pe name leune de ledeu kela nzwa, nnuide ledeu mecai, ge nnui au hekaknadung dida nah pe name meda. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Cirünne mene, anuide ledeukela anui pumteihbe peidung bamlie nah anui penuide rütla. Anui rabedung Pei sam au mzai kieeki delwe lungh maisia meni? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Kedanemene kesang anui peime penui macet yitube teu anuide kaknage ziemne ledeu. Dede Tinggwang anui ziemne yi kerabe anuide ledeu la, iciu eh pe kemci ga anui mzilu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Cu kesangbe au ledeukecu tingdau ga misuiyi eh la lama, dede kehereila la. Pecaine cide gade keteukelu ziemne makesangbe tsi kenciep bui beula. <verse eid="HEB 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Cine nnui badung nzumie kebamde nah nnui kemnei ngkokdung de teingkieng lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa. 35:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Nnui pi ziemne lampui kemzui teilu, iciude telwa kelade sia dilak dede yi luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Mac. 4:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang de mlaidi helo rangkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Mileune de ngngwa kezuyi lu, nah kemci cide simai migede Rampaube de ngau gailak. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Pielu peu mige dage de Tinggwang ngaugia gahdi melu kera, nah kekaa mah gede lunghcuh eh keherei teigai so, nah aide ne mina kekieege de tei heradi lubui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Hez. 29:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Pielu peu kemmha mede Esau nzwa rabe lam ncok kemak bam diso, tak kwakge ziemne pe kemna qwa zwatyei kedi. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Kedanemene nnui cibam pecaine de, Esau samlam de luuneu kedidau, pecu mlaidi, kedanemene pa pe miakdui zau eh cide peei liede, helungnreulu kera ziuyi pa ngaulu tadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Ken. 27:30-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Kedanemene nnui mage deulukebui da gwang melu, miheu kebaa, kemui, muiting kecu, nah rahang, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />nah telui kwakecu dage, mede sam rangbam kecu makwa ge da siu kelumedung kiedi penui dage sam kedage de rang sita lulo eh. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Kedanemene aja kai kegaide penui lia gailak kedine: “Magade makaune gene de lamlwa tungcai, cide tangtsu le sam tsetdi maisia.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Tet. 19:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Kengau aide hingzu kedine Moses rangdi, “Ih au ngngi nah mbeu dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Hez. 9:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Meliene, nnui au Zion Deutu ga nah ringkela Tinggwang namdi ga gwang luda, tinggim Jerusalem, nah tinggimgwame pecang hengyi kebam ga, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />nnui Tinggwang nerainadung zi tinggim ga rauteula kedi ngkwa ga gwang luda, nnui Tinggwang lie qu kelabe ma pelane reu hetutiak kelabe da gwang luda. Nnui tinggim ga teimci cangsiak kelu rabedung da gwang luda,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:6">Lei. 50:6</ref>, <ref loc="COL 1:12">Col. 1:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />nah hekak ketetbe, samkakkelu kehecibe teu kegwangbe Jisu da, nah Abel jai swa rang hemiki kecu hezin kegai jai deda. <verse eid="HEB 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Marang kebambe de nnui mlaidi melu kera mriak bamlu. Kedanemene magade Israelme paklu meliecai kideu ga penui dage rang kebeube de mlai kecudau, anui pak gailak lie magade tinggim gade anuide rangmriak kebeube Tinggwang dade anui nreutet dicai. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Ndaa piage, pe kwa ne kideu de kelai di. Dede cu pa sampetgai eh ranggai, “Piage si eh reu Ih kideube rünne mene, dede tinggim de de teukelai zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag. 2:6</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 5:4">Tut. 5:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 68:8">Lei. 68:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Dede samdung aide, “Piage si eh reu,” pekie be teukelai kedibe keugi di kera, cinzwa eh, teu kelailu kemakpe depeu bamlu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag. 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ciziemne, anui teu kelaigai kelak hegwangram <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Teu kelaigai kelak hegwangram: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pekie aide, Rikelu hegwangram madaude gah dilak. </char></note>ngaulu zeu delu, anui twa lugo, nah Tinggwang luulu kebui zai teu anui recalu kera gade, herüt nah kengngi teu eh. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Kedanemene anui Tinggwang au teingkapdi kela mi ge lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Hez. 4:24</ref>;<ref loc="DEU 9:3">9:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 33:14">Isa. 33:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Kecungkegai sam kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Peu caihereiswacing kereku bam jüja lu. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Mide hegia kecude nsungta diso, kedanemene aide gade, midungge cimene tinggimgwame de hegialu dilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:9">1 Pet. 4:9</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 18:1-19:3">Ken. 18:1-19:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Hebaangme de nsunglu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hebaangme de nsunglu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebaang, tei kebam pelane, hereu ketei gade, kedakpie kecu gade, makesang ziemne. </char></note> nnui penuide ngngwa kebam nzwa cet eh. Mine teikeherei kelame de nsunglu, nnui penuide nzangbam kecu nzwa cet eh. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Mileune depeu laktak de herüt peulo, nah laktak zeu de peu mcilu, kedanemene Tinggwang mmha eh mci kemakme nah kemmhame tutiak zielu. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Rangkang kehegin gade n zaireli peu kwak bamlu. Nda kebambe dungde teumnung lu, kedanemene Tinggwang rangla, “Ih ncu madaude gi dilak, meliene Ih ncu madaude püt dilak.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6-8">Hez. 31:6-8</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:15">Ken. 28:15</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Jos. 1:5</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 28:20">1 Hel. 28:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Cine anui kuu eh rang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">“Rampaube au acu kenghabe; Ih ngngi dilak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Mina a dage daige tei lulai?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Lei. 118:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Nnui kenlum muiteume de cetgailo, Tinggwang sam nnui dage rangkebeume dungde, nah penui tei kegai gade kepet de cetlu eh, penui kenlum de reli lu. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Jisu Khrista au nziene de, henai de, nah kelungta nzwa bamla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:2">Lei. 90:2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:8">Keu. 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 41:4">Isa. 41:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Keledeu ketsam tsam gage nnui mlung kai diso. Kedanemene n kengkieng au Tinggwang ngaugia gade gwangla, ketyeipok zaidung mnei kecu gade ma, cide au mnei kelamede de ngha lama. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Anui recabam ge bam cikade paiki ga mata keteime matyei kera pe nzeu gah. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Hezai kehegwabe kangga au, makaune jai kemaudung ziemne teitset kelube cingku kedibe ne kemci ni ga teulüt la, dede penui pumdung au paiki gwale ge ru dila. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Cine Jisu liede namdibe kirie gwale de keherei, pe jai gade minadung de teimci lu kerane. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Ciziemne anui ramzeuki gwale peda mie go, pa hengam keteide mzi lugo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:22">Luk. 6:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Kedanemene anui aika bammui kela namdi gede gah. Meliene, anui au gwang kerabe de pie lalu. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Anui Khrista dade, Tinggwang dage ketwa ratak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ketwa ratak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kelikelu ngaugai leune ziemne.</char></note> pwapeu mui lugo, cide cai, misam gade pe zi hetwa peu kecu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:14">Lei. 50:14</ref>;<ref loc="PSA 50:23">50:23</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 14:2">Hos. 14:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Dede anui makeyi ketei nah kemazi kecude gi diso, kedanemene ratak cikenzwadung Tinggwang pesui lalu. <verse eid="HEB 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Nnui muiteume samzai teilu, nah penui kerangbe teilu, nnui keringriadung pie rengei kera penui ta da, Tinggwang ne penui tutiakbe teilai eh kecu nzwa. Nnui muiteumedung depeu penui suiyi eh aide tei kera pekie keyibe teilu, nah ncamdi mene, kedanemene cide nnui ziemne kemta ge dizie lu.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Anui ziemne kielu, kedanemene anui au anui kecet mcigi eh bamkecu ci bamda nah anui ma pelane ga petaube tei eh lungh kera teineu la. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Dede Ih kecung si gaila nnuide aide tei kerane, iciu eh Ih nnuida cailigwang zilu kerane.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Cu peu kezuyi Tinggwang,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kezuyi Tinggwang, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“kezuyi” samkie aide samlam mede suiyi ketsamtsam de rangbam.</char></note> meurün kekwa kedibe de ketsai gade kwakcuhdai kelube, anui Rampaube Jisu, kelungta samkakkelu jai gade, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />nnuide ma keyi pelane gade mteilu pe lungningbe teilu kerane, anui lungga heta tei kebamde pe dwaga petaulu kera, Jisu Khrista gade, peu pecu kelungta mdu kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Sinamedung, kehecung sam duitu gade raukegaide ga lia gailo de, Ih nnuide kecung gaila, kedanemene Ih sam kieekemak nage gwale nnui dage raugai melu. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Anui sinabe Timothy de lungmpet kedi ci lulo, pa kelwa eh gwangcai Ih pecu ngngwa nnuide kerengau zie.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Nnui muiteume nah kemcime pelane de kelum gailo. Italy deudi ga kebamme nnuide kelum gaila.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Peu Tinggwang ngaugia nnui pelane da bamkelube tei lulo.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>